er&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=77c2b284fb49f3095541e0c905f155fb 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mi_dsu_nashi/works/29", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0baeae39/uploads/origins/38ad8db1-65fa-4d73-b67f-12eba381bc44?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e7d3898d1dbf259e6b87ad9be8061207", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0baeae39/uploads/origins/38ad8db1-65fa-4d73-b67f-12eba381bc44?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e7d3898d1dbf259e6b87ad9be8061207, https://si.imgix.net/0baeae39/uploads/origins/38ad8db1-65fa-4d73-b67f-12eba381bc44?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7230c9be3cd94e39a869bb9529f3d8e5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0baeae39/uploads/origins/38ad8db1-65fa-4d73-b67f-12eba381bc44?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=28e5cb89f8f4c2cc30114c22f5ccabc6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "おはようございます!\nこのオリキャラを描いていただきたいと思います: https://skeb.jp/@tanaka_dayo/works/3\nただし, 身長は小さめ. (～6頭身) https://imgur.com/a/2xAk2yo\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@ikasyuumai/works/120\n\n瞳孔を好きなように描くことができます.\n\n(古) https://imgur.com/a/zCmZWlD , https://imgur.com/a/FpM2ocE , https://skeb.jp/@y8m38/works/139", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mi_dsu_nashi/works/28", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bfc34d9c/uploads/origins/d5ee2501-8f0b-495f-9665-9e2a37940871?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d36a56a51929357aec4c8e382bf7d259", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bfc34d9c/uploads/origins/d5ee2501-8f0b-495f-9665-9e2a37940871?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d36a56a51929357aec4c8e382bf7d259, https://si.imgix.net/bfc34d9c/uploads/origins/d5ee2501-8f0b-495f-9665-9e2a37940871?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=93e76552c9b7